      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHES A DELANEY (8) ran into a smart one when returning with a second here two weeks ago but she'll be better for the hitout and is nicely placed against her own sex. Cops a wide draw but she did a great job at her maiden campaign, winning four races including the Pink Bonnet in the city. WALLABY WAY (3) resumes from a spell of four-and-a-half months after putting it together at the end of last campaign, placing behind SHES A DELANEY in the Pink Bonnet before winning twice in a row here. Might have developed further with maturity and is aided by a good draw. LEXY BELLE (9) makes her first appearance since she led to win here in April but she was readied with three nice trials and draws for a trail. SHOWEMHOW (4) is up in grade after she led for a last-start win at Young but she looked good there and draws well again.",
